            "value": 5
          },
          "kind": "circuit-step",
          "context": {
            "expectedValue": 5
          }
        }
      ],
      "finalAnswer": 5,
      "explanation": [
        "A Full Adder uses two cascaded half adders plus an OR gate: S = (A XOR B) XOR Cin (2 XOR gates). The carry output Cout = (A AND B) OR ((A XOR B) AND Cin) requires 2 AND gates and 1 OR gate. Total: 5 gates."
      ],
      "learningObjective": "Construct multi-input arithmetic bit-slices by cascading half adder stages.",
